---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Home">
  <section class="bg-hero px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm">Curiosity Driven Learning</span>
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Making <span class="text-slate-500">Mathematics</span><br />Natural Again.</h1>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          At NPconscious, we help students build strong fundamentals through curiosity, exploration, and understanding instead of memorization.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <a href="https://wa.me/918088276492" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-400 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-200/40 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5">Book Free Demo</a>
          <a href="#programs" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-slate-50">Explore Programs</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">160+</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Students</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">500+</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Goal by 2027</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">100%</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600">Student First</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-4 shadow-soft">
        <img src="/site-format.png" alt="Illustration showing learning layout" class="img-card" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-10 text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Our Philosophy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Start With Curiosity..</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-10 shadow-soft">
        <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          Learning was once natural. Today, it is often made unnecessarily complex in the race to get ahead. But true understanding comes from curiosity, exploration, and strong fundamentals.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          At NPconscious, we encourage students to think, question concepts, and build genuine interest in learning. Human progress has always been driven by curiosity — from discovering fire to building rockets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-10">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Why NP Conscious</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Learning That Feels Natural</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Curiosity First</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We encourage students to ask questions and deeply understand concepts.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Strong Fundamentals</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We focus on conceptual clarity instead of rote memorization.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Student-Centered</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Every student learns differently. We adapt to how children naturally think.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft transition hover:-translate-y-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Qualified Educators</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Our educators hold bachelor’s degrees in Engineering, Finance, Physics, or Mathematics.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8" id="programs">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl space-y-10">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Programs</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Designed For Every Stage</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 xl:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Foundation Mathematics.</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Grade 1–5</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">12 Sessions • 40 mins</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">5 Doubt Sessions</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Mathematics Concepts I</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Grade 6–10</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">30 Sessions • 50 mins</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">10 Doubt Sessions</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Mathematics Concepts II</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Grade 11–12</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">20 Sessions • 50 mins</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">5 Doubt Sessions</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Engineering Mathematics</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Advanced Learning</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">55 Sessions • 1 Hour</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">25 Doubt Sessions</p>
        </article>
        <article class="relative rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-amber-100 to-slate-50 p-8 pt-14 shadow-soft">
          <div class="absolute right-4 top-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-400 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-950 shadow-sm">Popular</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Money & Mathematics</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Financial Thinking</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">15 Sessions • 45 mins</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">5 Doubt Sessions</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-8 shadow-soft">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Tuition Program</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Grade 1–10</span>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">Daily • Weekly • Monthly<br />1 Hour Class + 10 Minute Guidance</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[58%_42%] lg:items-center">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-white p-4 shadow-soft">
        <img src="/letter.png" alt="Founder letter illustration" class="rounded-[2rem] object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-500">Founder Story</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Nikhil Parag</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          Nikhil Parag is an entrepreneur with a Bachelor of Engineering in Information Science, driven by curiosity, discipline, and a deep passion for learning and innovation.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          Having worked with renowned organizations such as Concentrix, Airbnb and Bhanzu, he developed a strong understanding of customer experience, scalable systems, and education-focused growth.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
          In January 2026, he began his entrepreneurial journey with the mission of making high-quality, curiosity-driven education accessible to students across different backgrounds. Built on a strong student-first philosophy and a commitment to excellence, the organization witnessed rapid growth within just a few months of its launch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-24 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-slate-950 p-16 text-center text-white shadow-soft sm:p-12">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Start Your Learning Journey</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Book a free demo session and experience curiosity-driven learning.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/918088276492" class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-slate-100">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
